Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------
Trinity's dependencies and their licences are listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, which is
generated from sbom.cdx.json, the CycloneDX bill of materials the quality gate produces on
every commit. The two cannot disagree: they are the same data rendered twice.

Two items are worth naming here because they are files in this repository rather than
dependencies fetched at build time:

  src-tauri/icons/*     Tauri Programme within The Commons Conservancy, MIT OR Apache-2.0.
                        The output of `mix ex_tauri.install`, which copies Tauri's template
                        icons. They are not this project's artwork and are not covered by
                        the copyright above.

  assets/vendor/*       Upstream authors, vendored unmodified, MIT. Listed per file in
                        REUSE.toml.

Per-file copyright and licensing for every file in this repository follows the REUSE
Specification, version 3.3. `reuse lint` exits 0 on this tree and runs in continuous
integration; the licence texts are in LICENSES/.
